{"time": 1770206242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403670442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊……”不着痕迹地后仰了点“矢吹同学有哮喘吗？”"}
{"time": 1770206285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525384813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”是、是的，有一点“"}
{"time": 1770206358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035240905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=122498327]”呃，关于刚才那个问题……“"}
{"time": 1770206377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010555540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那矢吹同学还是就坐我的位置吧...毕竟后面也有黑板，粉尘不会少的”"}
{"time": 1770206399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1601812453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”我其实是本地人，高中后就在外地读书了，最近才转回老家继续学习“"}
{"time": 1770206430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2029137377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2010555540]（原来后面也有黑板吗？）"}
{"time": 1770206453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "617023295", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“那就，谢谢矢吹同学了”"}
{"time": 1770206464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181717679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（咦？）"}
