{"time": 1770206530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458157809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（有点晕，咳缺氧了属于是）"}
{"time": 1770206594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "223478805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦哦，那应该很快就能适应这里的生活吧。”点点头“有什么事的话，找神山同学吧。”"}
{"time": 1770206645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584798062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我还真不知道后面也有黑板，不过你说有那就有吧。)"}
