{"time": 1770641712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1276921696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“矢吹酱，你刚转来还没加入社团吧，有什么感兴趣的吗”"}
{"time": 1770641727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782564975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（对策委员是什么啊（））"}
{"time": 1770641748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058448908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“得等对策委员长和你说明，在此之前尽量不要随便去...尽量保持谨慎吧”"}
{"time": 1770641753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1764017455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1276921696]“嗯，神山是在那个社团呢”"}
{"time": 1770641764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162666169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "(别问)"}
{"time": 1770641777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036372542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“剑道社啦，要和我一起去吗”摸摸腰间的木剑"}
{"time": 1770641881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1857547624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1036372542]“呃……可能对我来说有点太猛烈了。我应该会加入一些室内社团吧”"}
{"time": 1770641987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1282404980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我比较想知道上课看课外书不会被老师发现的技巧”"}
{"time": 1770642031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "778430239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“那么各位，我先去参加社团活动了，各位也不要在学校逗留太久哦”"}
{"time": 1770642035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "280889985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*准备离开"}
{"time": 1770642084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "863917366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我也准备去弓道社练习了。不过……为什么会选这个位置呢？”看着矢吹同学"}
{"time": 1770642122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040910604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "686998018", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=863917366]（啥意思）"}
